sequenceDiagram
  participant U as Upload / Stream
  participant V as VAD
  participant A as ASR
  participant D as Diarization
  participant C as Term Correction
  participant T as Transcript
  U->>V: audio chunks
  V->>A: speech segments
  A->>D: raw text with timestamps
  D->>C: speaker turns
  C->>T: corrected text
  T-->>U: transcript with speaker labels
